        </div>
      </div>
  
  






  <h4 class="flush--third--bottom font-size--h6 clear-left">Source: Consumer price inflation from the Office for National Statistics </h4>
      <div id="notes-9168398b" class="notes-holder-js">
  
      </div>
  
    <h4 class="print--hide padding-top--0 margin-top--0 font-size--h6 clear-left"><span role="text">Download this chart <span class="visuallyhidden">Figure 3: Easing in annual transport inflation driven by air fares </span></span></h4>

