                <div id="latest-movements-in-cpih-inflation" class="section__content--markdown">
                    <section>
                        <header>
                            <h2><span class="section__content-number">4.</span> Latest movements in CPIH inflation</h2>
                        </header>
                        <p>


  

    <div class="markdown-chart-container panel--bottom-mar print--avoid-break">

      <h3 class="flush--third--vertical font-size--18 padding-top--0 margin-bottom--1">Figure 5: CPIH goods annual inflation rate highest since October 2023, while services inflation lowest since July 2022 </h3>
        
            <h4 class="flush--third--bottom font-size--16 padding-top--0 margin-top--0">CPIH goods, services and core annual inflation rates, UK, August 2015 to August 2025 </h4>
        

      <div class="scrollable-container">
        <div id="chart-23ad1b74" data-filename="23ad1b74" data-uri="/economy/inflationandpriceindices/bulletins/consumerpriceinflation/august2025/23ad1b74" class="markdown-chart">
            <!--[if gt IE 8]><!--><noscript><!--[endif]-->
            <img src="/chartimage?uri=/economy/inflationandpriceindices/bulletins/consumerpriceinflation/august2025/23ad1b74&width=&hideSource=true" alt="" />
            <!--[if gt IE 8]><!--></noscript><!--[endif]-->
        </div>
      </div>
  
  






  <h4 class="flush--third--bottom font-size--h6 clear-left">Source: Consumer price inflation from the Office for National Statistics </h4>
      <div id="notes-23ad1b74" class="notes-holder-js">
  
      </div>
  
    <h4 class="print--hide padding-top--0 margin-top--0 font-size--h6 clear-left"><span role="text">Download this chart <span class="visuallyhidden">Figure 5: CPIH goods annual inflation rate highest since October 2023, while services inflation lowest since July 2022 </span></span></h4>

    <a class="btn btn--primary print--hide js-chart-image-src" data-filename="23ad1b74" href="/chartimage?uri=/economy/inflationandpriceindices/bulletins/consumerpriceinflation/august2025/23ad1b74" download="Figure 5: CPIH goods annual inflation rate highest since October 2023, while services inflation lowest since July 2022 " data-gtm-title="Figure 5: CPIH goods annual inflation rate highest since October 2023, while services inflation lowest since July 2022 " data-gtm-type="download-chart-image"  aria-label="Download Figure 5: CPIH goods annual inflation rate highest since October 2023, while services inflation lowest since July 2022  as an image">Image</a>
      
